{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[00:09.46](ATL Jacob, ATL Jacob)\n[00:11.14]Bitch, I'm a dog and I'm bad to the bone\n[00:14.46]Lil' nigga, watch your tone, shouldn't have left your gun at home\n[00:20.26]You know it be crackin', crackin', it be brakkin', brakkin'\n[00:22.66]Bitch, I'm a dog, and I'm bad to the bone\n[00:26.00]Lil' nigga, watch your tone, shouldn't have left your pole at home\n[00:31.46]Yeah, you know it be crackin', crackin', it be brakkin', brakkin'\n[00:35.22]Uh, we ain't never lack, that's a no-no, at least a few of us got our hands on a .4-0\n[00:41.04]Uh, we ain't never slippin', no, all of us are trained to blow, that means try any of us, you get it\n[00:46.64]Just to let you know, we don't have any time for these niggas, we on the money route\n[00:50.56]I would tell you to ask the last nigga, but he in heaven now\n[00:53.58]Or in hell, I don't know, I don't care, I'm busy getting the cake, I'm busy gettin' the dough\n[00:57.78]I don't know, I don't care but I know I just came up on a couple hunnid thou', yeah\n[01:02.68]On top of the millions that I already have, yeah, so much money in the air, hold on, let me grab it\n[01:07.90]I'm in the cut, oh, yeah, oh, yeah, kind of just like I stabbed it\n[01:11.22]He wanna fight, oh, yeah, oh, yeah, I may get to jabbin'\n[01:14.12]He wanna shoot, oh, yeah, oh, yeah, I may get to blastin'\n[01:17.00]Blastin' out the Aston, every day, I be cashin'\n[01:20.00]I told myself, \"Never ever in life will I be last,\" yeah\n[01:22.82]Now I got a platinum plaque on the way with a couple comin', oh, yeah\n[01:26.06]I'm on fire, huh, I get hotter, huh, as I get higher\n[01:29.84]These niggas should give it a rest, I ain't even breaking a sweat\n[01:32.74]My worst is better than they best, I do more and I say less\n[01:35.66]In a new Porsche, I'ma act a mess, I just came up on some Actavis\n[01:38.54]These niggas some squares like Madison, too lame for me, can't fathom it\n[01:41.54]I guess I'm too over average, killin' 'em all too, bitch, I'm a savage\n[01:44.06]Bitch, I'm a dog and I'm bad to the bone\n[01:46.96]Lil' nigga, watch your tone, shouldn't have left your gun at home\n[01:52.78]You know it be crackin', crackin', it be brakkin', brakkin'\n[01:55.20]Bitch, I'm a dog, and I'm bad to the bone\n[01:58.06]Lil' nigga, watch your tone, shouldn't have left your pole at home\n[02:03.98]Yeah, you know it be crackin', crackin', it be brakkin', brakkin'","words":[[9.46,10.06,"(ATL"],[10.12,10.86,"Jacob,"],[10.94,10.98,"ATL"],[11.02,11.1,"Jacob)"],[11.14,11.22,"Bitch,"],[11.28,11.38,"I'm"],[11.44,11.44,"a"],[11.58,11.96,"dog"],[12.02,12.1,"and"],[12.14,12.22,"I'm"],[12.3,12.52,"bad"],[12.66,12.74,"to"],[12.8,12.86,"the"],[13.02,13.36,"bone"],[14.46,14.62,"Lil'"],[14.8,15.04,"nigga,"],[15.18,15.52,"watch"],[15.56,15.68,"your"],[15.86,17.28,"tone,"],[17.32,17.52,"shouldn't"],[17.56,17.66,"have"],[17.7,17.88,"left"],[17.92,18.02,"your"],[18.08,18.42,"gun"],[18.52,18.62,"at"],[18.78,20.22,"home"],[20.26,20.36,"You"],[20.4,20.62,"know"],[20.68,20.72,"it"],[20.78,20.82,"be"],[20.94,21.28,"crackin',"],[21.32,21.68,"crackin',"],[21.78,21.8,"it"],[21.86,21.92,"be"],[22.04,22.36,"brakkin',"],[22.4,22.6,"brakkin'"],[22.66,22.74,"Bitch,"],[22.82,22.92,"I'm"],[22.98,22.98,"a"],[23.12,23.5,"dog,"],[23.54,23.62,"and"],[23.66,23.76,"I'm"],[23.86,24.06,"bad"],[24.1,24.12,"to"],[24.2,24.28,"the"],[24.58,25.78,"bone"],[26.0,26.06,"Lil'"],[26.38,26.56,"nigga,"],[26.74,27.08,"watch"],[27.12,27.26,"your"],[27.44,27.8,"tone,"],[27.86,28.86,"shouldn't"],[28.9,29.12,"have"],[29.28,29.42,"left"],[29.46,29.58,"your"],[29.64,30.1,"pole"],[30.18,30.2,"at"],[30.34,30.66,"home"],[31.46,31.68,"Yeah,"],[31.82,31.9,"you"],[31.96,32.18,"know"],[32.24,32.3,"it"],[32.34,32.4,"be"],[32.52,32.84,"crackin',"],[32.88,33.28,"crackin',"],[33.34,33.4,"it"],[33.44,33.5,"be"],[33.62,33.94,"brakkin',"],[33.98,34.54,"brakkin'"],[35.22,35.24,"Uh,"],[35.42,35.5,"we"],[35.58,35.7,"ain't"],[35.74,35.98,"never"],[36.14,36.4,"l